{"id":"5cf2cdaf54dc651b","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-compat.md","title":"Compatible partial specification","display":"df-compat — Compatible partial specification","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-compat","aliases":["27-df-compat"],"display":"df-compat — Compatible partial specification","depends_on":["[[27-df-vardom]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-compat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compat — Compatible partial specification"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，固定本文件各函数、项及关系的元数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb{B}^{n}\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb{B}^{n}\\)</span> (Boolean vectors, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}\\subseteq\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{B}^{n})^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}\\subseteq\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{B}^{n})^{2}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}(T,F)\\leftrightarrow T\\cap F=\\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Compatible}(T,F)\\leftrightarrow T\\cap F=\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A compatible pair prescribes no input to have both truth values.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-vardom]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb{B}^{n}$ (Boolean vectors, see [[27-df-vardom]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb{B}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compatible}\\subseteq\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{B}^{n})^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compatible}(T,F)\\leftrightarrow T\\cap F=\\emptyset","display":true}],"bytes":755,"backlinks":[{"id":"666257bc1bd5bf10","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T_i,F_i\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$ 且 $\\mathrm{Compatible}(T_i,F_i)$（$i\\in\\{1,2\\}$）；见 [[27-df-compat]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-compat|df-compat — Compatible partial specification]]"}],"outgoing":["4b84ee77aaf0c828"]}